"So the underground shrine symbolizes the new world to which Hachiman leads his followers. Is that it?"

pt:
//【護氏】
<voice name='護氏' class='護氏' src='voice/md01/0270210a05'>
//「地下という異空間に造られた下宮は、八幡
//神がもたらす新世界を象徴するもの。
