"Minhas desculpas, Vossa Senhoria―"

en:
//【護氏】
<voice name='護氏' class='護氏' src='voice/md01/0270290a05'>
//「それよりも致命的な失敗は、ここへ降りる
//までの歩き方……
//　距離の取り方であろうな」
"You've made another, more damning mistake... and that is the distance at which you've been walking."

//【護氏】
<voice name='護氏' class='護氏' src='voice/md01/0270300a05'>
//「神官如きが、予の<RUBY text='・・・'>斬り間</RUBY>を把握して自然と
//外すなどという振舞いをいたす筈がないわ」
"What kind of priest would make certain to stay just out of reach of my sword?"

pt:
//【護氏】
<voice name='護氏' class='護氏' src='voice/md01/0270290a05'>
//「それよりも致命的な失敗は、ここへ降りる
//までの歩き方……
//　距離の取り方であろうな」
"Você cometeu outro erro, bem mais condenatório... e é a distância que vem mantendo ao caminhar."

//【護氏】
<voice name='護氏' class='護氏' src='voice/md01/0270300a05'>
//「神官如きが、予の<RUBY text='・・・'>斬り間</RUBY>を把握して自然と
//外すなどという振舞いをいたす筈がないわ」
"Que espécie de sacerdote tomaria o cuidado de se manter sempre fora do alcance da minha espada?"

en:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0270310a00'>
